#: ../../source/docs/common-matekh743-wing.rst:146
#: 036e4a1985e5404c8f0430e80b37f0ff
msgid ""
":ref:`BATT_VOLT_MULT<BATT_VOLT_MULT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` 10.5 (note: "
