#: ../../source/docs/common-matekh743-wing.rst:156
#: a2d6dc3f55b24b1d80f04bbbbe9da286
msgid ""
"this autopilot uses a high precision current sensor which is sensitive to "
"ESC switching noise. Be sure to use the bypass capacitor provided. In some "
"cases, the ESCs themselves will need additional 200-330uF low ESR capacitors"
" on their power inputs, if they do not incorporate them already. See `Matek "
"FAQs <http://www.mateksys.com/?p=5712#tab-id-12>`__ for more information."
msgstr ""
"此飞控使用高精度电流传感器，对 ESC 开关噪声较为敏感。请务必使用随附的旁路电容。在某些情况下，ESC 本身的电源输入端需要额外焊接 "
"200~330uF 低 ESR 电容（如果其本身未内置）。详情请参阅 `Matek FAQs "
"<http://www.mateksys.com/?p=5712#tab-id-12>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-matekh743-wing.rst:159
#: 36c31b95e0e64540925ebbb841616c00
msgid "Firmware"
msgstr "固件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-matekh743-wing.rst:161
#: d62ed9e3279e43e0ad53a33e591f3a59
msgid ""
"Firmware for these boards can be found `here "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org>`_ in  sub-folders labeled \"MatekH743\"."
msgstr ""
"这些飞控的固件可在 `此处 <https://firmware.ardupilot.org>`_ 的 「MatekH743」子文件夹中找到。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-matekh743-wing.rst:164
#: 7e9b00eccc8a471085dcfa22bea803c7
msgid ""
"Firmware that supports :ref:`bi-directional Dshot <bidir-dshot>` is labeled "
"\"MatekH743-bdshot\"."
msgstr "支持 :ref:`双向 DShot <bidir-dshot>` 的固件标记为 「MatekH743-bdshot」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-matekh743-wing.rst:166
#: 4977de6257474a00abf65597a7b44bd2
msgid ""
"The bi-directional Dshot firmware redefines the Rx6 pin as a pure UART "
"input, and cannot support PPM. It also requires that the "
":ref:`SERIAL7_PROTOCOL<SERIAL7_PROTOCOL>` = 23 and that "
":ref:`SERIAL7_OPTIONS<SERIAL7_OPTIONS>` = 3 for use with SBUS to provide "
"inversion. In addition, outputs 9-12 no longer support normal Dshot. Only "
"outputs 1-8 are bi-directional Dshot capable, with 1-2,3-4,5-6,7-8 in "
"groups. Finally, the buzzer in the USB dongle will no longer play musical "
"tones, only simple buzzer beeps."
msgstr ""
"双向 DShot 固件将 Rx6 引脚重新定义为纯 UART 输入，不支持 PPM。还需要 "
":ref:`SERIAL7_PROTOCOL<SERIAL7_PROTOCOL>` = 23，且使用 SBUS 时需要 "
":ref:`SERIAL7_OPTIONS<SERIAL7_OPTIONS>` = 3 以提供反相。此外，输出 9-12 不再支持普通 "
"DShot，仅输出 1-8 支持双向 DShot，分组为 1-2、3-4、5-6、7-8。最后，USB "
"加密狗中的蜂鸣器将不再播放音乐音调，只发出简单的蜂鸣声。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-matekh743-wing.rst:169
#: 0db49c1c480d4fe5a0cb50c2f1089d04
msgid "Loading Firmware"
msgstr "加载固件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-matekh743-wing.rst:170
#: 7a88accc574b400fb78f91ef5fc51e2e
msgid ""
"Initial firmware load can be done with DFU by plugging in USB with the "
"bootloader button pressed. Then you should load the \"with_bl.hex\" "
"firmware, using your favorite DFU loading tool."
msgstr ""
"初始固件可通过按住引导程序按钮并插入 USB 进入 DFU 模式进行烧录。然后使用您常用的 DFU 烧录工具加载 「with_bl.hex」固件。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-matekh743-wing.rst:172
#: 6161da6bbc1b4073af83ca50632cbc49
msgid ""
"Once the initial firmware is loaded you can update the firmware using any "
"ArduPilot ground station software. Updates should be done with the "
"\"\\*.apj\" firmware files."
msgstr "初始固件加载完成后，可使用任何 ArduPilot 地面站软件更新固件。更新时应使用 「\\*.apj」固件文件。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-matekh743-wing.rst:174
#: d836ae37fae34c1c94357288989055a3
msgid ""
"If you experience issues with the device ceasing to initialize after power "
"up, see :ref:`common-when-problems-arise` section for H7 based autopilots "
"for a possible solution."
msgstr ""
"如果遇到设备上电后无法初始化的问题，请参阅 :ref:`common-when-problems-arise` 章节，了解基于 H7 "
"的飞控的可能解决方案。"
